# Local developer configuration only. The deployed settings live in
# .env.production, which IS tracked: Vite bakes it in at build time, so a
# build without it ships a dashboard that cannot reach the API.
#
# Nothing secret belongs in either. If that ever changes, the value goes in
# Railway's variables instead, not here.
.env
